      "id": "claim_6fcb7c6453b24503a58db49c983383ca",
      "statement": "The feedback endpoint is the only enforced rate-limit policy: its limiter dependency runs before any session-using dependency, reads the feedback limit settings per request, and resolves the subject as the JWT id, else a namespaced anon: id from the body, else None which skips the limit and lets the service answer 401.",
